nHigh-capacity water storage reservoirs to prevent dry spells\n\nRainwater harvesting systems to collect and conserve monsoon water\n\n|  |  |\n --- |\n| Narang Valora Price | Rs. 5.97 Cr - 12.01 Cr |\n| Property Types | Flat |\n| Project Type | Residential |\n| Narang Valora Status | Under Construction |\n| Narang Valora Launch Date | 01 May 2026 |\n| Narang Valora Possession Date | 01 December 2031 |\n| Towers in Narang Valora | 2 |\n\n### Narang Valora Floor Plan [...] The units have vast windows to let in natural light.\n\nLiving in Narang Valora keeps you close to commercial workspaces.\n\nProperties in this micro-market show consistent long-term rental demand.\n\n### What People Say about Narang Valora\n\nTravel comfort is high as Ram Mandir station is very close.\n\nThe nearest metro station takes just 5 minutes to reach.\n\nMultiple dining options and restaurants operate in the immediate vicinity.\n\nS V Road hosts prominent retail brands and useful showrooms.\n\nThe Jawahar Nagar area acts as a highly favorable business location.\n\nLocal markets provide easy access to fresh daily groceries.\n\nThe presence of 24/7 security personnel reassures nuclear families.\n\nMaintenance costs might turn out a bit elevated over time.","score":0.82082915,"raw_content":null,"id":"508705-02"},{"url":"https://narangvaloragoregaon.co.in","title":"Narang Valora Goregaon West - New Launch Projects Bangur Nagar","content":"Narang Valora also provides its exclusive amenities, such as a swimming pool ... Narang Valora Goregaon West Location Site. Goregaon Railway Station - 5","score":0.8018276,"raw_content":null,"id":"8f25f0-03"},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/narang-valora","title":"Narang Valora Goregaon West - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","content":"This project offers 20+ amenities. Key external amenities include Gymnasium, Indoor games, Creche Play Area, Seating Area, and Banquet Hall.","score":0.7795405,"raw_content":null,"id":"f5b66e-04"},{"url":"https://narangrealty.com/projects/residential/narang-valora","title":"Premium 3 BHK in Goregaon West - Narang Realty","content":"Life at Narang Valora extends beyond a collection of amenities. Across nearly 1.25 lakh sq. ft. of experiences, Club Valora brings together wellness, recreation","score":0.71088976,"raw_content":null,"id":"42ddfc-05"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/narang-valora-photos-goregaon-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-npxid-r467679","title":"Narang Valora Photos and Videos - Goregaon - 99Acres","content":"Swimming Pool Facilities3. Yes, buyers can view amenity visuals for Narang Valora, images covering the swimming pool. includes sports zones along with indoor","score":0.680136,"raw_content":null,"id":"26e9f1-06"},{"url":"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/narang-valora-goregaon-luxury-3-4-5-bhk-homes-in-goregaon-west/289517266","title":"Narang Valora Goregaon – Luxury 3, 4 & 5 BHK Homes in ...","content":"Narang Valora Goregaon offers premium 3, 4 & 5 BHK residences in Bangur Nagar, Goregaon West, Mumbai. Explore spacious homes, modern amenities, elegant","score":0.61057013,"raw_content":null,"id":"a5bf7e-07"}],"response_time":4.28,"request_id":"e2d9d09a-7d56-4982-b43b-dce41fecf4a6"}